Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.89,0:00:06.03,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,This is your last bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.03,0:00:09.40,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama's birthday is the 24th of this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:11.49,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Christmas Eve!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.77,0:00:13.88,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,She'll be really happy if \Nyou celebrate it with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:17.95,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,I see! Thank you, Master! No, my goddess!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:24.99,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:27.69,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop making contact
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.08,0:00:30.43,Flashback,Yoshino,0,0,0,,with you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.83,0:00:36.63,Flashback,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:19.99,Episode Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1475,925)}#6 "{\c&H2F89F0&}O{\c}u{\c&H2F89F0&}r {\c}S{\c&H2F89F0&}e{\c}c{\c&H2F89F0&}o{\c}n{\c&H2F89F0&}d {\c}D{\c&H2F89F0&}a{\c}t{\c&H2F89F0&}e{\c}"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:16.49,Main Top,Aki,0,0,0,,My birfdayth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:21.95,Main Top,Masamune,0,0,0,,I was born in January, \Nbut I was wondering when you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.99,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Huh... When do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:29.33,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Uh... I dunno. I'm not really \Ngood at guessing. Maybe summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:32.92,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, you're way off. It's December 24th.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.31,0:02:38.17,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,She's so cute when she makes faces \Nlike that. Just like when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:41.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh... So you were born on Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:43.64,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Let me celebrate that day with you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:47.66,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,That's not a bad proposal \Ncoming from you for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:53.82,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Is that an okay? Yes! I did it, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:56.52,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Aki-sama, here's your extra mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:03.58,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Right. That was the agreement. \NShe's so thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:10.59,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Anyway, I can't get any more help from Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:13.25,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'll have to think up these \NChristmas plans myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:17.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0\fs10\b1\move(178,90,178,197)\an7\c&HE5DBD6&\fay-.15\frx4\fry350}Here's Our\NRecommended\NChristmas Course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:17.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\3c&HA981DC&\bord1\blur1\fs14\fnTrebuchet MS\frz8.494\move(454,163,454,270)}Cute Christmas Fashion\Nand Accessories ♥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.25,0:03:17.21,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H825CD3&\3c&HE2E1E5&\bord1\fnTrebuchet MS\an1\fs14\move(369,50,369,157)\frz30.28}Our Best Christmas Date\NReport!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:16.68,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,But there are just too many options...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.70,0:03:19.48,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,S-Say, Chinatsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:20.33,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:23.23,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,If you were going on a Christmas \Ndate, what would you like to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.23,0:03:27.39,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,A Christmas date? \NWhy, go to a castle, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:28.18,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:32.90,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,I'd rent out a whole castle, \Ncosplay as a princess, and dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.08,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm talking about something \Nrooted in reality here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.08,0:03:38.25,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Oh. Then I guess I could \Ncompromise and settle for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.25,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,dinner at a hotel with an ocean view.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:43.02,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,You middle school girls sure expect a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:45.37,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,What's this? Are you talking about dates?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:49.95,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Mom! You've had a Christmas \Ndinner with Dad before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:52.73,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,I have! But it was so troublesome
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:55.74,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,because they accidentally \Nbrought out a kids' lunch for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.74,0:03:56.70,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:59.00,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,And then they brought out Hamburg steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:03:59.44,Main Top,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:02.76,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah, my bad for even \Nasking you two in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:00.88,Main Top,Kinue,0,0,0,,I couldn't eat all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.88,0:04:01.63,Main Top,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Did you, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:04.26,Main Top,Kinue,0,0,0,,Yeah. My stomach was so full.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:08.01,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Oh. Hey, by the way, Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.36,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Since we're talking about Christmas,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:14.23,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Mom did a lottery in the \Nshopping district today and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.72,0:04:19.90,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,When all else fails...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:24.82,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'll have to rely on the bible of a million girls, \Nas well as my own... {\i0}Rose-eyed Steroid{\i1}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.82,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frx50\fry356\frz238.1\fax.2\c&H966CDE&\3c&HECEEED&\pos(432.666,177.333)}Rose-eyed Steroid
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:24.82,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frx50\fs14\fry356\fax.2\c&HD0716D&\3c&HECEEED&\pos(382,150)\frz235.2}Hanano Rabuko
