Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.00,0:04:34.00,sign_6498_61_That_s_fine,Speech bubble,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(534,178)\frz8.563\fs14}...\Nwas\Nruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:41.74,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Christmases in 2D are so overshadowed by \Nother incidents that it's not Christmas at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:52.41,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Maybe I should just buy some new outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.82,0:04:53.81,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.88,0:05:00.01,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'd look amazing \Nin any of them, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:03.65,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,A perfect place for a Christmas date?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:05.60,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Shh! Not so loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:09.31,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,S-Sorry. Is this for you and Adagaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:10.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.30,0:05:12.86,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Aw, that sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:16.27,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I've been researching a lot, \Nbut nothing's really speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:19.66,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Well, I know plenty of \Nexceptional restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:24.63,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs12\fnTrebuchet MS\b0\c&HD6A4A6&\3c&HF9FCF3&\bord1\frz188.8\frx16\fry2\pos(350.667,209.333)}Italian "Buono"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.91,0:05:24.63,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,The fresh pasta at this \NItalian place is amazing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.63,0:05:27.47,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,and this place has great \Nsuper-soft Hamburg steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:30.36,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,Oh, and you need a reservation \Nfor the pancakes at this café,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:33.74,Main,Kojuurou,0,0,0,,but they're super yummy! \NYou have to try them once before you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.74,0:05:35.16,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.35,0:06:13.74,Main,Employee,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.65,0:06:14.31,Main,Employee,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.09,0:06:21.98,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Just five more minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:25.80,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.48,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:39.44,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, just... I guess you really did decide \Nagainst cosplaying as Hada Pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:42.28,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Th-That was just Yoshino's mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.28,0:06:44.41,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I know. You told me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:48.09,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Just forget about it already! \NRight this second! Sooner, if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:51.90,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,So, what are we going to do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.60,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I couldn't think of anything too creative,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.60,0:07:00.95,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,so sorry it's a rehash of last time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.95,0:07:02.27,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,No zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:03.77,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.37,0:07:06.44,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:09.31,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I didn't rent out the whole theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.31,0:07:11.02,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I guess I can't expect too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:15.20,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.74,Flashback,Aki,0,0,0,,You're too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.05,0:07:20.42,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I bought one extra seat to \Nthe side again, just in case,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:22.71,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,but I doubt it'll be any different...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:30.76,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not going to tell you \Nnot to sit next to me if we're dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.89,0:07:40.39,Italics,Old Man,0,0,0,,Pochi! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.83,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I can't even concentrate...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.83,0:07:47.64,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,The smell of popcorn and \Nthe actors' cheesy lines
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.64,0:07:49.83,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,are messing with my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:55.57,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,But I should try not to forget...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:08:01.83,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,that the feelings we feel right \Nnow actually made us happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:03.43,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,They weren't a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.86,Main,Narino,0,0,0,,Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.71,0:08:14.46,Main,Narino,0,0,0,,It's Christmas. Why do you look so gloomy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.90,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I don't. And Christmas doesn't concern me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:19.75,Main,Narino,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:20.55,Main,Narino,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:25.27,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.98,Main,Narino,0,0,0,,Work, you dummy. Well, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.57,0:08:37.78,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Th-That wasn't fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.36,0:08:40.89,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I let my guard down because \Nyou said there were no zombies,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:43.81,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,but it was a story about \Nan old man and animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:44.91,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.91,0:08:47.77,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,This time, she's crying because \Nshe was moved to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.77,0:08:51.55,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. Just calm down. \NI have reservations at a café nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.14,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,A café?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:59.44,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What's it like?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:01.55,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I guess they serve pancakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:05.29,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,The Sweets General recommended \Nit to me, so it should be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.03,0:09:09.07,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It should be around here somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:11.76,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It's on the second floor \Nof a building with a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:13.98,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Could it be that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:21.64,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Um... Is everything oka—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:24.83,Main,Owner,0,0,0,,My shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:28.25,Main,Girl A,0,0,0,,Oh... That fire this morning \Nmust've been at this café.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:30.62,Main,Girl B,0,0,0,,I guess so. It was really good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.04,Main,Girl A,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:39.21,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I guess I now belong in \Nthe 2D world of incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:42.84,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,W-We'll just have to go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.84,0:09:44.18,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.51,0:09:45.93,Main,Female Employee,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:46.94,Main,Male Employee A,0,0,0,,We are currently...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:49.23,Main,Male Employee B,0,0,0,,We apologize for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:52.23,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Curse you, Christmas...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:55.50,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,It's fine. This is just a \Nbad time to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:57.28,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,We can give up for today, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:58.46,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, Adagaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,We mustn't give up so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:04.00,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea just how \Nmuch research I did for this day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:08.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So for you to tell me give up so easily... \NI can't let that slide, even if it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:10.03,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Do you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.03,0:10:12.60,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,O-Okay, fine. Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.60,0:10:14.38,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What are we going to do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:19.80,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Somewhere else that's nearby, \Nwhere we can eat and rest...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.38,0:10:24.94,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Want to come over to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:35.00,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Are you sure your family \Nwill be okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:38.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's fine. I'm sure they'll \Nwelcome you with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:41.95,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Just like when Master and \NFujinomiya-san came over...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:45.88,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Go on, eat up. We've got \Nchicken and cake ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.95,Main,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,What?! Onii-chan finally lucked out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:52.71,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Actually, they might be a bit annoying...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:55.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,M-Maybe it'll be okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:59.74,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,It's fine. We're already here, \Nso I'll accept your invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:05.10,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,They might make a big fuss \Nat first... but they won't bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.32,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Do you have a ferocious dog or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:08.68,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.06,0:11:12.15,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:14.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,H-Hang on one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.82,0:11:23.75,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Wait, no one's here. That can't be right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:28.97,Italics,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,I'm going to the hot springs with Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:36.46,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H382A1D&\an3\fs14\fnTrebuchet MS\bord0\move(386,172,386,22)}I'm going to the hot springs with Mom!\NIt's the thing Mom won in the lottery!\N~Chinatsu~
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:36.46,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H382A1D&\an3\fs14\fnTrebuchet MS\bord0\move(360,325.333,360,175.333)\fscx90}Your dad is on a business trip until tomorrow.\N{\fscx}Too bad we all couldn't go together.\N-Mom-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.97,0:11:31.54,Italics,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,It's the thing Mom won in the lottery!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.12,Italics,Kinue,0,0,0,,Your dad is on a business trip until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.46,Italics,Kinue,0,0,0,,Too bad we all couldn't go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:39.50,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I-I didn't hear anything about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:42.28,Flashback,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Since we're talking about Christmas,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:45.89,Flashback,Chinatsu,0,0,0,,Mom did a lottery in the \Nshopping district today and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:49.07,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,That's what she meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:51.35,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Um, Makabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:54.22,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Is your family not home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.22,0:11:57.08,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Um, uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.02,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.60,0:12:06.74,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,This means...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.44,0:12:12.52,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Basically, this means we're \Ncompletely alone together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.19,Main,Frank and Muriel,0,0,0,,Joyeux Noel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.39,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,So yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.63,0:12:34.89,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,To think that I get to spend Christmas \Nwith my adorable little sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:37.52,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,I'm so blessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.97,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Stop being so dramatic. \NYou're embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.53,0:12:48.44,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Here. Your present.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:52.45,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:56.71,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,I'm happy that I get to spend \NChristmas with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:01.96,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,M-Muriel... I'm so glad to be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.85,0:13:05.92,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Oh, and here's a list of circles \NI want you to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:07.93,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,This one's super popular right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:08.84,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.84,0:13:11.21,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,You're going to Japon again at \Nthe end of the year, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.21,0:13:13.35,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,S-So what you're saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:18.36,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Will you go to the huge year-end \Ndoujinshi event for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:23.76,Main,Frank,0,0,0,,Of course I will! \NLeave this to your big brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:25.53,Main,Muriel,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.49,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H382A1D&\an3\fs14\fnTrebuchet MS\bord0\move(386,172,386,22)}I'm going to the hot springs with Mom!\NIt's the thing Mom won in the lottery!\N~Chinatsu~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.49,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H382A1D&\an3\fs14\fnTrebuchet MS\bord0\move(360,325.333,360,175.333)\fscx90}Your dad is on a business trip until tomorrow.\N{\fscx}Too bad we all couldn't go together.\N-Mom-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:34.87,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of trap?! \NDid I just leap into a wolf's den?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:38.83,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Does she think I did this on purpose? \NNo! This is a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:41.90,Main,Masamune and Aki,0,0,0,,Um—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.34,0:13:49.55,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,C-Calm down. You'll be finished if \Nyou panic and show him weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.03,0:13:53.77,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty! You won't be convincing \Nat all if you're acting suspicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.63,0:13:58.23,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,W-Well, I guess if they \Naren't here, they aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.90,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I mean, we just stopped by to have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.69,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,This is no problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:08.36,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Or what? Did you have \Nsome ulterior motive in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.66,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,L-Like hell I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:15.58,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,In that case, Makabe Masamune-kun, \Ncould I have some tea, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:17.08,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.59,0:14:24.84,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Damn it! I feel like I lost somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.44,0:14:28.39,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Anyway, tea. Where are the tea leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:31.71,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Maa-kun, do you want some snacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.71,0:14:33.07,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,Want some roll cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.07,0:14:35.52,Main,Kinue,0,0,0,,I made a parfait! Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:40.69,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Are there only snacks in this whole household?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.69,0:14:43.96,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Tea leaves, please! \NI will even accept tea bags!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:47.47,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey. Can't you even make tea quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.47,0:14:50.16,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh, er... I was just looking for the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:54.65,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,And you can't find it. I figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.97,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Whatever. You can just get some cups out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:59.16,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll help you look for the tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:00.14,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:08.38,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh... I guess she can be pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:10.52,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Say, Makabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:11.45,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.45,0:15:14.97,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,We were supposed to eat pancakes today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.68,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\c&H525770&\3c&HD8DEEA&\shad0\fs12\bord1.5\b1\frz11.49\pos(322.667,248.667)}For Meals or Dessert!\N{\c&H2E75D7&}Fluffy {\c&H525770&}and Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.68,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\c&H354B7E&\3c&HB0D9F2&\shad0\fs10\bord1.5\b1\pos(448.667,247.333)\frz353.6}You can make\Nthem with {\c&HBEA64C&}water
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.68,0:15:21.85,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(20,20)\fs12\c&H5D6261&\3c&HE4E9E8&\shad0}1. Mix eggs and milk in a bowl.\NNext, pour in the pancake mix and\Nstir well.\N\N2. Make sure the frying pan is heated.\NPut in a little bit of oil, and then\Npour in the batter.\N\N3. Fry them on low heat for 3 minutes,\Nflip them over, and fry them\Nfor another 2 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:21.85,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,First we add the powder to some milk and eggs...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:24.09,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I found them both in your fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.09,0:15:28.61,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Once the batter is mixed, you just fry \Nthem in the frying pan... apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.99,0:15:38.06,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,That side's done. Better flip it over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:40.25,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,All right... Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.43,0:15:45.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Adagaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:47.96,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.22,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:57.06,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Makabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:16:01.02,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well... we managed to make some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.02,0:16:03.15,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,We never did find the tea, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:05.86,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Well, we found a can of \Nhot cocoa, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.37,0:16:07.31,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.31,0:16:09.48,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I honestly wanted sugar-free...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:26.59,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Hot cocoa and pancakes... Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:28.92,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,But she seems happy, so it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.72,0:16:31.51,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Here. Open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:37.30,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Oh? What's wrong? Did that get to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.63,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,This is nothing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:41.92,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You're still mad about earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.73,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,I don't know. Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:48.97,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Everyone always says I'm sadistic, \Nbut you're far more sadistic than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.00,0:16:58.20,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I felt something weird there just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.52,0:17:00.64,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,The flavor's definitely lacking something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:02.70,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You didn't add enough toppings!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:07.05,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:10.21,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,This is way too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:13.82,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Why? I think it's suitable for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:17.91,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Suitable for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:21.03,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,What the heck do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.03,0:17:22.64,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:25.35,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I saw vanilla ice cream in the freezer—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.07,0:17:27.16,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Adagaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:30.68,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:31.54,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.88,0:17:35.53,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,What's with you all of a sudden, Makabe?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:40.83,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,This is my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.69,0:17:51.50,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,That, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:02.31,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:06.23,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,You still had this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:08.54,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:11.82,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,No! That's not the point, Aki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.11,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Masamune?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:18.22,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,It's true that I'm the fat little Masamune \Nyou knew eight years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:21.96,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,But I wanted to change from that, \Nand that's how I became who I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:25.62,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,So it's a bit hard for me when someone \Nwants me to go back to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.61,0:18:31.92,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Even if it was all a misunderstanding, \NI can't imagine wanting to be my old self.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.67,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:39.18,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Am I worthless... the way I am now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:41.19,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Wai—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:44.92,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:53.15,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:01.32,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Makabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.55,0:19:03.32,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:04.83,Main,Masamune,0,0,0,,Excuse me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:09.51,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:18.67,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,What the hell am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:25.31,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Where the heck did Makabe go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:27.50,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Honestly, what's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.50,0:19:30.22,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,First he invites me over, \Nand then he just disappears!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:37.23,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(325,0)\fs10\bord0\shad0\pos(298,57.333)\frz339.7}Messages
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:37.23,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(325,0)\fs11\bord0\shad0\pos(376.667,83.333)\frz338.8}Makabe Masamune
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.44,0:19:37.23,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(325,0)\fs10\bord0\shad0\frz339.7\pos(462.667,124)}Edit
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.73,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\pos(373.333,195.333)\fs12\an4\c&HB69B68&\bord1\shad0\frz339.6\3c&HF6C16B&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.73,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\fs12\an4\c&HA0A5A4&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8FCF8&\frz337.6\pos(252,215.999)}In the 2nd floor\Nbathroom RN
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:37.23,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,0)\fs12\an4\c&HA0A5A4&\bord2\shad0\3c&HF8FCF8&\frz337.6\pos(282,148.666)}In the 2nd floor\Nbathroom RN
