Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.68,0:19:54.17,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,A present?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:57.54,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:05.43,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I should be grateful that my \Nphone was in my butt pocket or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:08.14,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,But seriously, I'm in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:10.78,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,Were the loli hag's ingredients \Nrotten or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:15.65,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\an4\c&H8F9492&\bord2\shad0\3c&HFBFFFE&\frz17.55\pos(250.666,182.667)}Okay.\NTake care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.89,0:20:15.65,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\an8\c&H979490&\bord2\shad0\3c&HFAE6AE&\frz17.55\pos(193.333,230.667)}Cruel Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:18.36,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:25.62,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,The last time I had a stomachache, \NI didn't break out in hives like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:27.99,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,They started appearing when...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:36.52,Italics,Masamune,0,0,0,,I can't touch Adagaki Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:43.05,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:45.26,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:48.04,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,The master is having a Christmas party.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:50.36,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,I slipped away from bingo duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.36,0:20:52.62,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,I see. Well, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:20:59.82,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Was your date not fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:02.06,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.06,0:21:03.93,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,That's not true...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:07.10,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,That's not true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.66,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Say, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.77,0:21:17.08,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Could it be that I have no \Nappeal as a woman at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.35,0:21:24.65,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,You have plenty of appeal, Aki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:27.86,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,No, forget it! Never mind! It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.23,0:21:41.00,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,They look just like Sean and Lancelot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:46.53,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Those memories are irreplaceable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.75,0:21:49.94,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't you feel the same way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:54.00,Main,Aki,0,0,0,,That's what I thought, at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:22:00.00,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H707677&\shad0\3c&HEAF1F0&\fs14\frz54.13\frx12\fry2\pos(160,214)}I'm going to get revenge\Non that woman!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.02,0:22:08.04,Italics,Aki,0,0,0,,What did that mean?
